Source: base/multidimensional.jl:378-379. -/
def ConcreteRegionConversionPreservesCoordinates : Prop :=
  ∀ input : Region64, RegionDomain input →
    ConversionOutcome .unit input (regionConvertConcrete .unit input) ∧
    ConversionOutcome .stepped input (regionConvertConcrete .stepped input)

/-- Built-in region equality terminates, is reflexive and symmetric, and a true
comparison implies agreement of every mathematical axis sequence. If all axes
